# ParcelTrack.http: requests you send with one click.
# In Visual Studio, open this file and click "Send request" above a request.
#
# @host is the address in your browser when you press F5 (the http profile).
@host = http://localhost:5420

@staff_token = {{staffLogin.response.body.$.token}}
@admin_token = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 1. Every parcel, with fees. Expect 200 OK (fees 800, 650, 1250, 2000, 1250)
GET {{host}}/api/parcels

### 2. Add a parcel with no token. Expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingCode": "PT-200201",
  "recipient": "Damion Clarke",
  "weightKg": 4.2,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 5
}

### 3. Log in as Staff. Expect 200 OK + token
# @name staffLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@parceltrack.test",
  "password": "Pass123!"
}

### 4. Log in as Staff with the wrong password. Expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@parceltrack.test",
  "password": "WrongPass1!"
}

### 5. Request 2 again, with the Staff token. Expect 201 Created + Location header
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client: Branch desk

{
  "trackingCode": "PT-200201",
  "recipient": "Damion Clarke",
  "weightKg": 4.2,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 5
}

### 6. Staff token, bad tracking code AB-12. Expect 400 Bad Request: "Tracking code must look like PT-123456"
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingCode": "AB-12",
  "recipient": "Damion Clarke",
  "weightKg": 4.2,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 5
}

### 7. Staff token, no X-Client header. Expect 400 Bad Request: "Say which program is calling: add an X-Client header"
POST {{host}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingCode": "PT-200202",
  "recipient": "Nadine Walker",
  "weightKg": 1.0,
  "status": "Received",
  "branchId": 1
}

### 8. Delete parcel 5 with the Staff token. Expect 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{host}}/api/parcels/5
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_token}}

### 9. Log in as Admin. Expect 200 OK + token
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@parceltrack.test",
  "password": "Pass123!"
}

### 10. Delete parcel 5 with the Admin token. Expect 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/parcels/5
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
X-Client: Branch desk
